{"ticker":"ASML","updated":"2026-10-23T22:38:49Z","profile":{"longName":"ASML Holding N.V.","shortName":"ASML Holding N.V. - New York Re","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"Netherlands","website":"https://www.asml.com","fullTimeEmployees":44681,"marketCap":605799579648,"trailingPE":38.67618,"forwardPE":25.015871,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":15.346994,"pegRatio":0.95,"targetMeanPrice":2143.4207,"targetHighPrice":2847.468,"targetLowPrice":866.8236,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.552,"earningsGrowth":1.359,"grossMargins":0.54337,"operatingMargins":0.44356,"profitMargins":0.34135,"totalRevenue":39473500160,"beta":1.302,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1999.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":946.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.58},"summary":"ASML Holding N.V. provides lithography solutions for the development, production, marketing, sales, upgrading, and servicing of advanced semiconductor equipment systems. The company offers lithography, metrology, and inspection systems. It also provides extreme ultraviolet lithography systems; and deep ultraviolet lithography systems comprising immersion and dry lithography systems solutions to manufacture various range of semiconductor nodes and technologies. In addition, the company offers metrology and inspection systems, including YieldStar optical metrology systems, a diffraction-based wafer metrology platform to assess the quality of patterns on the wafers; and HMI electron beam solutions to locate and analyze individual chip defects. Further, it provides computational lithography solutions, and lithography systems and control software solutions; and refurbishes and upgrades lithography systems, as well as offers customer support and related services. Additionally, the company offers hardware, software, and services to chipmakers to produce the patterns of integrated circuits. It operates in Japan, South Korea, Singapore, Taiwan, China, rest of Asia, the Netherlands, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the United States. The company was formerly known as ASM Lithography Holding N.V. and changed its name to ASML Holding N.V. in 2001. ASML Holding N.V. was founded ","summary_zh":"ASML Holding N.V. 為先進半導體設備系統的開發、生產、行銷、銷售、升級和服務提供光刻解決方案。該公司提供光刻、計量和檢測系統。它還提供極紫外光刻系統；深紫外光微影系統，包括浸沒式和乾式微影系統解決方案，用於製造各種半導體節點和技術。此外，該公司還提供計量和檢測系統，包括 YieldStar 光學計量系統，這是一個基於衍射的晶圓計量平台，用於評估晶圓上圖案的品質；和 HMI 電子束解決方案，用於定位和分析單個晶片缺陷。此外，還提供計算光刻解決方案、光刻系統和控制軟體解決方案；翻新和升級光刻系統，並提供客戶支援和相關服務。此外，該公司還為晶片製造商提供硬體、軟體和服務來生產積體電路圖案。該公司在日本、韓國、新加坡、台灣、中國、亞洲其他地區、荷蘭、歐洲其他地區、中東、非洲和美國開展業務。公司前身為 ASM Lithography Holding N.V.，2001 年更名為 ASML Holding N.V.。 ASML Holding N.V. 成立","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體設備與材料","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":754.75,"h":758.26,"l":752.09,"c":754.46,"v":731100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":758.77,"h":763.5,"l":755.91,"c":763.2,"v":860100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":760.0,"h":770.58,"l":757.79,"c":770.0,"v":1140700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":770.0,"h":773.17,"l":760.87,"c":763.46,"v":985400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":753.0,"h":753.6,"l":739.79,"c":742.62,"v":1317800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":717.21,"h":727.2,"l":716.2,"c":725.85,"v":1867400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":732.22,"h":738.3,"l":729.56,"c":736.82,"v":1330300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":737.05,"h":756.9,"l":735.43,"c":753.43,"v":1532700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":774.88,"h":783.1,"l":766.24,"c":781.7,"v":1887300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":789.65,"h":798.7,"l":786.75,"c":796.25,"v":1284500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":795.2,"h":805.84,"l":793.12,"c":805.13,"v":1324100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":806.82,"h":809.6,"l":791.02,"c":793.14,"v":1634300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":799.69,"h":809.15,"l":798.51,"c":804.16,"v":1297800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":808.52,"h":815.78,"l":806.3,"c":813.87,"v":1019700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":834.93,"h":868.72,"l":833.92,"c":867.3,"v":2702300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":879.94,"h":881.46,"l":867.57,"c":878.42,"v":1832400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":868.23,"h":877.63,"l":861.18,"c